{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119612","id":3719756393,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7dtvpp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119612","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119612.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119612.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119612","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119612/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119612/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119612/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/609d94712c51f068fe84b960c4fef94d3e9d5709","number":119612,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Document ImageFormatLoader LoaderFlags Constants","user":{"login":"wkesner","id":7720142,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjAxNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7720142?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner","html_url":"https://github.com/wkesner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wkesner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe `LoaderFlags` enum constants on `ImageFormatLoader` (`FLAG_NONE`, `FLAG_FORCE_LINEAR`, `FLAG_CONVERT_COLORS`) do not have descriptions. This PR documents all three, which are the only undocumented items on the class.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nVerified each flag by reading its consuming code rather than inferring behavior from the flag names:\r\n\r\n- `FLAG_FORCE_LINEAR` triggers `srgb_to_linear()` in the PNG, HDR, TinyEXR, and SVG loaders. Set by the texture importer (`resource_importer_texture.cpp`).\r\n- `FLAG_CONVERT_COLORS` applies the forced color map in the SVG loader (`image_loader_svg.cpp`), set by the texture importer when `convert_editor_colors` is enabled.\r\n- `FLAG_NONE` is the zero/default value.\r\n\r\nA note for reviewers: `FLAG_CONVERT_COLORS` is currently only consumed by the SVG loader. If the intent is more general, I'm happy to adjust the wording.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## AI Disclosure\r\n\r\nI used Claude Opus 4.7 (Anthropic) as a learning and editing aid while writing these descriptions. Specifically, it helped me with the LoaderFlags bitfield concept and walked me through the Git/PR workflow as a first-time contributor. I identified which image loaders use each flag and verified their behavior by reading their source code myself. The final wording is my own.\r\n","labels":[{